{"name":"Moonlight Melody","hex":"#af73b0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"moonlight","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The light reflected from the Moon, which seems to emanate from it.","The silvery colour of the light reflected by the Moon."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To do a moonlight flit: to secretly leave premises without paying the rent, supposedly at night by the light of the Moon.","To do a moonlight flit: to secretly leave premises without paying the rent, supposedly at night by the light of the Moon."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/moonlight"},{"term":"melody","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A temporally ordered, perceptually coherent succession of pitched sounds, heard as a unified musical line or idea."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/melody"}],"entries":[{"title":"Perfect Velvet","blocks":[{"text":"Perfect Velvet is the second studio album by South Korean girl group Red Velvet. Released by SM Entertainment on November 17, 2017, the record incorporates R&B, soul and hip-hop with influences from future bass, trap and synth-pop, and saw contributions from various songwriters and production teams. The album is a portrayal of the group's \"velvet\" concept, making it their second major release to follow this sonic direction since their second extended play, The Velvet (2016). The album reissued as The Perfect Red Velvet on January 29, 2018."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/dd/Perfect_Velvet-cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perfect_Velvet"},{"title":"Moonlight","blocks":[{"text":"Moonlight is light from the surface of the Moon, consisting mostly of reflected sunlight, and some earthlight."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Earthshine_Moon.jpg/330px-Earthshine_Moon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moonlight"},{"title":"Melody","blocks":[{"text":"A melody, also tune, voice, or line, is a linear succession of musical tones that the listener perceives as a single entity. In its most literal sense, a melody is a combination of pitch and rhythm, while more figuratively, the term can include other musical elements such as tonal color. It is the foreground to the background accompaniment. A line or part need not be a foreground melody."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/BachFugueBar.png/330px-BachFugueBar.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melody"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/23/The_Perfect_Red_Velvet_cover.jpg/250px-The_Perfect_Red_Velvet_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/23/The_Perfect_Red_Velvet_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/23/The_Perfect_Red_Velvet_cover.jpg/250px-The_Perfect_Red_Velvet_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThe_Perfect_Red_Velvet_cover.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Tonsvatnet%2C_t%C3%A5ke_og_m%C3%A5ne.JPG/500px-Tonsvatnet%2C_t%C3%A5ke_og_m%C3%A5ne.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Tonsvatnet%2C_t%C3%A5ke_og_m%C3%A5ne.JPG/1280px-Tonsvatnet%2C_t%C3%A5ke_og_m%C3%A5ne.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Tonsvatnet%2C_t%C3%A5ke_og_m%C3%A5ne.JPG/500px-Tonsvatnet%2C_t%C3%A5ke_og_m%C3%A5ne.JPG?utm_s